Look up the latest stock prices of NVIDIA (NVDA) and AMD, then calculate the percentage difference of NVIDIA's price relative to AMD's price.

SUPERVISOR [route]
researcher: Find the latest stock prices for NVIDIA (NVDA) and AMD. (There are no research notes available, so the researcher needs to gather the latest stock prices.)

RESEARCHER [research]
The latest stock prices are as follows:

- **NVIDIA (NVDA)**: $173.86 [source](https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA)
- **AMD**: $585.30 [source](https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD)

To calculate the percentage difference of NVIDIA's price relative to AMD's price, we use the formula:

\[
\text{Percentage Difference} = \left( \frac{\text{Price of NVDA} - \text{Price of AMD}}{\text{Price of AMD}} \right) \times 100
\]

Substituting the values:

\[
\text{Percentage Difference} = \left( \frac{173.86 - 585.30}{585.30} \right) \times 100 \approx -70.34\%
\]

Thus, NVIDIA's stock price is approximately **70.34% lower** than AMD's stock price.

SUPERVISOR [route]
analyst: Calculate the percentage difference based on the provided research notes. (The research notes contain the necessary stock prices, and now we need to perform the calculation.)

ANALYST [analysis]
NVIDIA's stock price is approximately **70.30% lower** than AMD's stock price.

JUDGMENT: value=-70.295575

SUPERVISOR [route]
validator: Check if the research notes and analysis notes are sufficient together. (Both research and analysis notes are present, and it's time to validate their sufficiency.)

VALIDATOR [validation]
passed=True: Research cites sources and the analysis includes a calculated value.

SYNTHESIZER [synthesis]
NVIDIA's stock price is approximately **70.34% lower** than AMD's stock price. You can find the latest stock prices at the following sources: NVIDIA [source](https://ca.finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA) and AMD [source](https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AMD).

